1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ciechanower Reb 
2 CONT
2 CONT ============
2 CONT " My name is Malka Ryvka Mlawski. My father was Jozef Mlawski and his father was Rafal Mlawski. My father told me that he had known his grandfather, Hersz Mlawski who was an orphan and had grown up in Rabbi Avraham Ciechanower's h
2 CONC ome- 
2 CONT
2 CONT who was Hersz's grandfather."
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Discovery of the Tent/Tomb of Rabbi Rafael Landa of Warsaw
2 CONT What I discovered and wanted to share with you is finding the burial place of Rabbi Rafael Landa is the Jewish cemetery on Okopowa Street, plot 49, and this is the link, even though the cemetery has not yet updated it on the websi
2 CONC te, but this is the place. https://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/info/id_90286/back_1:0/backto_list
2 CONT My evidence: The lists made by the cemetery keeper [I attached file https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0?ui=2&ik=0033804337&attid=0.1&permmsgid=msg-a:r-8768175955850678426&th=19cc2dde45247d07&view=att&disp=inline&realattid=f_mmeqsl580
2 CONC &zw] show that in plot 49 there are 4 tents 1. The tent of Rabbi Yaakov of Tschichow, the link to its location is attached https://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/info/id_114618/back_1:0/backto_list 2. Rabbi Moshe David of Kalushin 3. Rabb
2 CONC i Rafael of Tschichow, this is Rabbi Rafael Landa [I have proof if it is important, I will provide it to you] 4. And the tent in Brisk of Rabbi Berlin Naftali Zvi Yehuda, and Rabbi Soloveitchik Chaim. Their tent was also found htt
2 CONC ps://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/info/id_90100/back_1:0/backto_list https://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/info/id_164293/back_1:0/backto_list What remained unidentified was the tent of Rabbi Moshe David of Kalushin and Rabbi Rafael Landa. And
2 CONC  now I found that the research conducted by the cemetery {from filehttps://mail.google.com/mail/u/0?ui=2&ik=0033804337&attid=0.2&permmsgid=msg-a:r-8768175955850678426&th=19cc2dde45247d07&view=att&disp=inline&realattid=f_mmeqsl5e1&
2 CONC zw } identifies this tent https://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/info/id_90415/back_1:0/backto_list as the tent of Rabbi Moshe David. It does not determine the tent of Rabbi Rafael, but those who know that Rabbi Rafael is also buried ther
2 CONC e know that they found the tent of Rabbi Rafael. I put a sign on the grave of Rabbi Moshe David, my great-great-great-grandfather. I also suggest that you inform the family members that whoever gets there should go up to visit the
2 CONC  grave. With blessings, Yehezkel Milstein
2 CONT https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0?ui=2&ik=0033804337&attid=0.3&permmsgid=msg-a:r-8768175955850678426&th=19cc2dde45247d07&view=att&disp=safe&realattid=f_mmesv7rv2&zw
2 CONT For further details, please contact me by email3145444@gmail.com
