3 CONT My evidence: The lists made by the cemetery keeper [I attached file https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0?ui=2&ik=0033804337&attid=0.1&permmsgid=msg-a:r-8768175955850678426&th=19cc2dde45247d07&view=att&disp=inline&realattid=f_mmeqsl580
3 CONC &zw] show that in plot 49 there are 4 tents 1. The tent of Rabbi Yaakov of Tschichow, the link to its location is attached https://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/info/id_114618/back_1:0/backto_list 2. Rabbi Moshe David of Kalushin 3. Rabb
3 CONC i Rafael of Tschichow, this is Rabbi Rafael Landa [I have proof if it is important, I will provide it to you] 4. And the tent in Brisk of Rabbi Berlin Naftali Zvi Yehuda, and Rabbi Soloveitchik Chaim. Their tent was also found htt
3 CONC ps://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/info/id_90100/back_1:0/backto_list https://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/info/id_164293/back_1:0/backto_list What remained unidentified was the tent of Rabbi Moshe David of Kalushin and Rabbi Rafael Landa. And
3 CONC  now I found that the research conducted by the cemetery {from filehttps://mail.google.com/mail/u/0?ui=2&ik=0033804337&attid=0.2&permmsgid=msg-a:r-8768175955850678426&th=19cc2dde45247d07&view=att&disp=inline&realattid=f_mmeqsl5e1&
3 CONC zw } identifies this tent https://cemetery.jewish.org.pl/info/id_90415/back_1:0/backto_list as the tent of Rabbi Moshe David. It does not determine the tent of Rabbi Rafael, but those who know that Rabbi Rafael is also buried ther
3 CONC e know that they found the tent of Rabbi Rafael. I put a sign on the grave of Rabbi Moshe David, my great-great-great-grandfather. I also suggest that you inform the family members that whoever gets there should go up to visit the
3 CONC  grave. With blessings, Yehezkel Milstein
3 CONT https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0?ui=2&ik=0033804337&attid=0.3&permmsgid=msg-a:r-8768175955850678426&th=19cc2dde45247d07&view=att&disp=safe&realattid=f_mmesv7rv2&zw
3 CONT For further details, please contact me by email3145444@gmail.com
