1 NOTE {geni:about_me} G13.2 '''Ziss,''' married R. Isaac Eizik Asher Kihen, born in 1835 died at age thirty-five about 1871 in Rechnitz, Austria and buried in Lodz, son of R. Judah Zvi Kihen.  He was the author of ''Yad Yitzchak'', two 
2 CONC commentaries, ''Be'er HaMelech'' and ''Orchot HaMelech'' to the ''Rambam's Mishne'' Torah (Fundamental Laws of the Torah), published in Warsaw in 1864.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source
2 CONT
