1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jankiel Icek Frydenzon was born in Uniejow, Poland in 1895 to Gershon and Sara Dwora nee Polacz. He was a merchant and married to Liba nee Brikman with 6 children. Prior to WWII he lived in Lodz, Poland. During the
2 CONC  war he was in Lodz, Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jankiel Icek was murdered in the Shoah (according to this source).
2 CONT
2 CONT This information is based on a Page of Testimony (displayed here) submitted by his son, Moshe Frydenzon Fridenzon
