1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Touba Shatan nee Fridenzon was born in Uniejow, Poland in 1892 to Gershon and Dwora Sara. She was married to Avraham Eli with 6 children. Prior to WWII she lived in Konstantynów, Poland. During the war she was in K
2 CONC onstantynów, Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Touba was murdered in the Shoah (according to this source).
2 CONT
2 CONT This information is based on a Page of Testimony (displayed here) submitted by her nephew, Moshe Frydenzon Fridenzon
