1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Menachem israel Dobrzynski was born in in 1894 in Lodz, Poland to Khanokh and Rivka. He was a merchant and married to Paja Fruma. Prior to WWII he lived in Lodz, Poland. During the war he was in Lodz, Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Menachem israel was murdered in the Shoah.
2 CONT
2 CONT This information is based on a Page of Testimony (displayed here) submitted by his son, Avraham Khanokh Dobzhinski
