2 CONT Cemetery Notebook: Born in Kalisz in 1863, Samuel Zvi Weltsman travelled through Eastern Europe prior to WWI and recorded the epitaphs of some 921 prominent Jewish personalities, buried in 51 communities. Today almost none of the 
2 CONC cemeteries he visited survive.
