1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sara Handelsman nee Veingot was born in Zdunska Vola, Poland in 1898 to Hersh and Khana. She was an embroiderer and married. Prior to WWII she lived in Lodz, Poland. During the war she was in Lodz, Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sara was murdered in the Shoah (according to this source).
2 CONT
2 CONT This information is based on a Page of Testimony (displayed here) submitted by her daughter, Gila Boiman
