1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Emigrated to Israel alone as a young woman from Makow, Poland in the mid-1930's due to religious persecution in Poland.  Was helped through the Beit Yaakov school system and a man from her region named Simcha Smols
2 CONC ky who had emigrated earlier.  They were not related although she later married Simcha's nephew, Natan. There were many connections between her mother Rosa's hometown of Makow and Natan's hometown of Mlawa, Poland.  Rosa's parents
2 CONC , my great-grandparents were also from Mlawa.  It's possible the Weingold and Frenkel families were already related.
