2 CONT     היה בגיטו לודז,אושוויץ בירכנאו(שם אביו נלקח למשרפות,אמו גוועה ברעב בגיטו לודז ב 1942), עבד בעבודות כפיה,צעד בצעדת
2 CONT
2 CONT המוות,עלה לישראל ב 1948,אחיו היחיד נהרג במלחמת השחרור,
2 CONT
2 CONT שירת בצ.ה.ל. 30 שנים במגוון תפקידים
2 CONT
2 CONT השתתף יחד עם אחיו הגדול בפעולות המחתרת נגד הנאצים ועוזריהם.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''היה בעל אישיות יוצאת דופן,ישר והגון, בעל ואב למופת,,אהב לעזור לאחרים,תמיד ראה את הצד הטוב ביותר של האנשים,חתר תמיד לאמת,ניסה תמיד לפשר ולמנוע מריבות וחיכוכים.=
2 CONT זכרון מעשיו הטובים ויושר המידות שלו,הם נחמתי.
2 CONT '''
2 CONT נפטר ממחלת סרטן הריאות,במאי 1997
2 CONT
2 CONT קבור בבית העלמין הישן בראשון לציון לצד רעייתו האהובה,ושם מנוחתו כבוד
2 CONT יהי זכרו ברוך,אמן
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Direct  descendant of the holy   rebbe menachem  mendel morgenstern ztk"l -the kozker Rebbe and to his son  the holy   Rebbe dovid morgenstern ztk"l - the second  Admor of Kozk from his daughter Rbz. Rivka Weingot(morgenstern),son
2 CONC  of Hakadosh Rabbi Chaim Lazer zt"l hy"d{direct descendant to kroll  Dynasty,Descendant of the Maharal from Prague, Rabbi Mordechai Yaffe...Rashi...King David} and Faiga Gitel z"l hy"d(nee rajzman-the great Granddaughter of rabbi 
2 CONC dovid morgenstern- the admor of kozk ztk"l), grandson of haZadik haNistar  rebbe benjamine  menachem(Benasz)wartski  ztk"l -   Which was one of the 36 righteous people and Malka Rivka wartski(nee halter)z"l-Direct descendant of th
2 CONC e Maharal from Prague,grandson of haChassid Rabbi Zysman Rajzman zt"l{direct descendant of frenkel teomim Dynasty, to bronowski and rajzman  families:were from a philanthropic family of the founders of the Jewish settlement in Lod
2 CONC z and the great- grandson to rabbi  josek frenkel A.B.D. Wolbrom and zarki}  and dyszka rajzman/werdiger(nee weingot-teomim) z"l hy"d{Granddaughter of rabbi dovid morgenstern ztk"l-the admor of kozk), great-grandson of  haChassid 
2 CONC and Teacher and Rabbi shraga feivel wajzngot -teomim(direct descendant of  frenke teomim dynasty) ztk"l and to rivka weingot-teomim(nee morgenstern-the dauther of rabbi dovid morgenstern-the admor of kozk ztk"l,great-grandson of R
2 CONC abbi Mordke Eliasz Halter(A.B.D. blaszki and Piotrkow) zt"l,and great-grandson  of  rabbi moshe meir wartski(leader&parnas of kalisz) zt"l
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendants of families: Benvenisti, karo, vital.
2 CONT
2 CONT direct descendant of a dynasties:Babad,frenkel,frenkel teomim, HaGadol( rabbinic dynasty),HaLevi Horowitz, Halpern, Isserles ,Kalonymus,Katzenellenbogen,jaffe, kroll,landau,Lifshitz,luria, Margaliot,  Meisels ,Minz,MiRomi( Azulai)
2 CONC ,morgensten(Hassidut kozk),Rapoport,rivlin, Rothenburg,salomon,Shapira,Schrentzel, Shachna,Shmulman ,Shor,Staden, Trabotto-colon,Treves,WEIL 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==direct descendant to rashi-king david&Queen Bat-Sheba,also son after son  to Aaron- High Priest==
2 CONT
2 CONT an extraordinary personality, was an exemplary husband and father, Straight and decent,always loved to help others, always saw the best side Of the people.
2 CONT  from His father's side he  is choen on his mother's side (in previous generations-the halevi  Horowicz family) he  is from  the Levi family
2 CONT
2 CONT Was in the Lodz ghetto, Auschwitz  Birkenau,Where his father was taken to the crematoria(His mother died of starvation in the Lodz ghetto), worked in forced labor, marched on a death march,Immigrated to Israel in 1948 and lost his
2 CONC  only brother in the War of Independence, served in the Israel Defense Forces for 30 years in a variety of positions
2 CONT
2 CONT ==The memory of his good deeds and his integrity are my consolation==
2 CONT
2 CONT  R.I.P.
2 CONT
2 CONT      AMMEN
