2 CONT Translation of death record:
2 CONT It happened in the town of Noworadomsk [now: Radomsko] on 11 June 1893 at 2 o'clock in the afternoon. Appeared Berek Witenberg [Wittenberg], age 64, and Lewek Witenberg, age 43, synagogue sextons living in the town of Noworadomsk,
2 CONC  and stated that on this day at twelve o'clock after noon[*] died Izrael-Icek Rabinowicz, 29 years old, leaves behind his widowed wife Fajgla-Chaja née Sztam?, living in the town of Zduńska Wola. After eyewitness confirmation of h
2 CONC is death, this act was read aloud to those present and signed by them.
2 CONT [*] seems to be 00:00 o'clock
