1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rajzl Gerzon nee Rabinovitz was born in Radomsko, Poland in 1885 to Elazar and Rakhel. She was a housewife and married with 3 children. Prior to WWII she lived in Poland. During the war she was in Lodz, Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rajzl was murdered in the Shoah (according to this source).
2 CONT
