2 CONC 72853d97ef9eb9bdf938ba0bc8 MyHeritage Family Trees] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 12 2019, 14:21:24 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Rabbi Shmiel Tzvi (“Hirsch”) Weinfeld: born in 1848 or 1855 in Gorlice, died December 24, 1932 in Jerusalem. His wife was Sara Friedman. He left Gorlice and went to live in Stropkov. In 1909 and 1910 he was deported from Stropkov 
2 CONC due to anti-Semitism. His deportation was noted in almost all German-language Jewish newspapers of the time, such as Jüdische Volksstimme, December 29, 1910:
2 CONT
2 CONT The 62-year-old rabbinical judge Hirsch Weinfeld has lived in Stropkov for 42 years and was first expelled by the district judge last summer. He appealed to the Vice President of Slovakia, who in September decided in his favor. De
2 CONC spite this, he received another deportation order from the border police these days. And all this is happening under the supposed "liberal" regime of the Ministry!
