1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Harav '''Meir Soloveichik''' was born in 5689/1929 to his illustrious parents, Harav '''Yitzchak Ze’ev''' (Reb Velvel) and Rebbetzin '''Hendel''', in Brisk, Belarus, where his father served as Rav and Rosh Yeshivah
2 CONC  following the petirah of his father, Harav Chaim Brisker, zt”l. Growing up in the home of the Torah giants of Brisk left an everlasting impression on Reb Meir.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Brisker Rav and his family managed to leave Europe and arrived in Eretz Yisrael in 5701/1941, where the Rav reestablished the Brisker Yeshivah in Yerushalayim. Reb Meir was twelve years old at the time. He learned in Yeshivas 
2 CONC Eitz Chaim, and later under the tutelage of his father.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Brisker Rav would fondly call Reb Meir the “iluy” of his sons and would often talk to him in learning.
2 CONT
2 CONT When he came of age, Reb Meir married, lhbch”l, Rebbetzin '''Elisheva''', the daughter of Rav Yechiel '''Benedikt''', zt”l, of Bnei Brak, a close confidant of the Chazon Ish, zt”l. He was married just a few months before the petir
2 CONC ah of his father, the Brisker Rav.
2 CONT
2 CONT In Yerushalayim, Reb Meir disseminated Torah to hundreds of bachurim and avreichim, teaching them the noted Brisker derech halimud. His yeshivah was on Rechov Reishis Chochmah, in the Zichron Moshe neighborhood.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reb Meir was noted for his Chumash and Rashi shiurim, in which he would intertwine words of mussar to his talmidim.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was 87 when he passed away in 3 Apr 2016.
2 CONT
2 CONT His children;
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. R' '''Yitzchak Ze’ev''', husband of Chana Miller, who succeeded his father as Rosh Yeshivah.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. R' '''Yechiel Naftali''', husband of Liba Weinberger, who opened a new yeshivah.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. R' '''Chaim'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. R' '''Avraham''', husband of Reichel Kogalsky.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. R' '''Yosef Dov'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Rebz. '''Hendel''' who is married to R' Tzvi '''Grossbard'''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://hamodia.com/2016/04/02/hagaon-harav-meir-soloveichik-ztl/
2 CONT
2 CONT Wikipedia page (in Hebrew). https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D7%9E%D7%90%D7%99%D7%A8_%D7%A1%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%95%D7%91%D7%99%D7%99%D7%A6%27%D7%99%D7%A7
