1 NOTE {geni:about_me} With heavy hearts, we announce the passing of our dear Julie Danielle Globus, at the tender age of 39. Beloved daughter of Swani and Morton Globus, precious sister of Brian Globus (Sarah Jensen), granddaughter of t
2 CONC he late Saul and Mildred Globus, and the late C.J. and Agnes Vethamany. Julie will also be dearly missed by her aunts, uncles, cousins from both sides of the family, as well as by the dear friends she has touched. Jul, you are for
2 CONC ever in our hearts. We live with the love and light you brought into our lives and will always cherish your free spirit and the happy times we spent with you.  Julie's family will receive friends on Monday from 2-4 and 7-9pm at th
2 CONC e Ratz-Bechtel Funeral Home, 621 King St. West, Kitchener. A service celebrating her life will take place on Tuesday morning at 11 o'clock in the chapel of the funeral home, with a reception to follow at the Ratz-Bechtel Family Ce
2 CONC ntre. Interment at Parkview Cemetery, Waterloo.  We thank everyone who has helped Julie with the struggles in her young life. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Memorial donations may be made to the Mental Health units of:
2 CONT
2 CONT St. Joseph's Hospital, Toronto St. Michael's Hospital, Toronto Centre for Addiction and Mental Health (CAMH), Toronto Grand River Hospital, Kitchener
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary's Place, YWCA, Kitchener Sistering, 220 Cowan Ave., Toronto, M6K 2N6 
