1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Our Aunt Dina was married to Isaac Langner. He was beautiful (looked exactly like I imagine Jesus looked like,soft brown hair and beard,big brown eyes, dark complexion) but had unusual habits. He made Shabbat (kidd
2 CONC ush) on Thursday and completed it (havdalah) on Monday. He spent a lot of time on his personal grooming. He walked down the middle of the road so that he wouldn't be near other women.  Aunt Dina had a difficult time coping with hi
2 CONC m.  Isaac travelled across Canada and like to think of himself as a Rabbi.  His father and two brothers were Rabbis,  One of the brothers married Victor and Rhoda Shields. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
