2 NOTE Hello, distant cousins!
3 CONT
3 CONT The Harry Silverstein in this photo is my maternal grandfather, and is not the same Harry from the rest of the photos. The two Harrys are cousins.
3 CONT
3 CONT The Harry Silverstein in this photo is the son of Solomon Silverstein and Chava (Eva) Moskowitz (not Chava Pachter, who is actually the aunt of my grandfather).
3 CONT
3 CONT Also, my grandmother was Mae, not May. 
2 NOTE May's not  listed... does she go by another name?
