3 CONT -J
2 NOTE from the left - Chaya Esther Silverstein, Dolly Silverstein (Jack), Faye Gold, Rhoda, Frimette, Ruth Wagner, May Silverstein (Harry), Dinah, Harry Silverstein. Jack Silverstein is standing between Irving and Willie
2 NOTE that's a nice story, thanks for sharing.
2 NOTE You're right! I can describe that coffee table in detail. I can even see the color of the flowers in my mind's eye.
3 CONT The 3 sisters loved your grandparents so much and wanted to emulate your Bubie's tasts. My mother nver gave up looking for a similar table for our living room. Ah! Memories...they make me cry and smile at the same time.
2 NOTE Thank you for the nice comment! these pictures are indeed great to look at. if i'm not mistaken this picture was taken in my grandparents' living room on Briar Hill Avenue
2 NOTE Hi Jamie,
