1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yosef_Shapira      '''Yosef Shapira יוסף שפירא‎], (26 December 1926 – 28 December 2013) was an Israeli politician and educator who served as Minister without Portfolio between 1984 and
2 CONC  1988, although he was never a member of the Knesset. Born in Jerusalem during the Mandate era, Shapira was amongst the leadership of Bnei Akiva and the National Religious Party.
