1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.geni.com/people/Moshe-Gorodentzik/6000000060300011973 '''עסקן מרכזי בחסידות בעלז, עיתונאי ופובליציסט ישראלי-חרדי. מכהן כחבר הכנסת''']
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yisrael_Eichler
2 CONT
2 CONT Yisrael Eichler (Hebrew: ישראל אייכלר‎, IPA: [ˈjisʁaˈʔel ʔaiχˈleʁֻ]; born 27 March 1955) is an Israeli politician. A member of Agudat Yisrael, he served as a member of the Knesset for the party and the United Torah Judaism allianc
